# Slice 283 probe: code over immutable data writes the place through var.  Entry 7.
Data:
    int: x 10
end: Data
Code:
    var\x: 9
end: Code
fn: m () int
    b: immutable: merge(Data)
    ---
        call: Code b
        return: 90
        catch: interpreter ()
            return: b\x
    ---
end: m
int: code 7
if: m() != 10
    code: 11
---
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: code; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
